{%- when 'caffeine-free-focus' -%}<li><a href="/blogs/news/functional-mushroom-drinks">Mushroom drinks: the complete guide</a></li><li><a href="/blogs/news/how-long-does-lions-mane-take-to-work">How long does lion&rsquo;s mane take to work?</a></li><li><a href="/blogs/news/mushroom-drink-vs-energy-drink">Mushroom drink vs. energy drink</a></li>
{%- when 'functional-mushroom-drinks' -%}<li><a href="/blogs/news/are-functional-mushroom-drinks-safe">Are functional mushroom drinks safe?</a></li><li><a href="/blogs/news/what-do-mushroom-drinks-taste-like">What do mushroom drinks taste like?</a></li><li><a href="/pages/recipes">10 mushroom mocktail recipes</a></li>
