{%- when 'mushroom-drink-vs-energy-drink' -%}<li><a href="/blogs/news/functional-mushroom-drinks">Mushroom drinks: the complete guide</a></li><li><a href="/blogs/news/how-long-does-lions-mane-take-to-work">How long does lion&rsquo;s mane take to work?</a></li><li><a href="/blogs/news/caffeine-free-focus">Caffeine-free afternoons: what actually works</a></li>
{%- when 'why-are-mushroom-drinks-so-expensive' -%}<li><a href="/blogs/news/functional-mushroom-drinks">Mushroom drinks: the complete guide</a></li><li><a href="/blogs/news/how-long-does-lions-mane-take-to-work">How long does lion&rsquo;s mane take to work?</a></li><li><a href="/blogs/news/mushroom-drink-vs-energy-drink">Mushroom drink vs. energy drink</a></li>
